---
number: 198
title: Come to Jesus
sp_category: "16"
topic: The Gospel Call
---

[verse 1]
Come to Jesus, Come to Jesus,
Come to Jesus just now;
Just now come to Jesus,
Come to Jesus just now.

[verse 2]
Come confess Him, Come confess Him,
Come confess Him just now;
Just now come confess Him,
Come confess Him just now.

[verse 3]
He will hear you, He will hear you,
He will hear you just now;
Just now He will hear you,
He will hear you just now.

[verse 4]
He’ll forgive you, He’ll forgive you,
He’ll forgive you just now;
Just now He’ll forgive you,
He’ll forgive you just now.
